From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:35:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Escape closes the location box before the dialog

Escape in the location box closed the whole file dialog. The box closes
itself on Escape (its unfocus handler) without capturing the key, so the
same Escape then reached on_escape, found nothing open any more and
cancelled the dialog.

The dialog now notes when the location box closes; an Escape within
half a second after that is the one that closed it and does nothing
more. The next Escape closes the dialog as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

